# Copy to .env.local for local development. Git-ignored; never commit secrets.
#
# This file lists ONLY the NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables that frontend code reads.
# Every NEXT_PUBLIC_* value is shipped to the browser, so only publishable
# values may ever live in one.
#
# Mock mode is the default: when NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MODE is unset (or anything
# other than "live"), MSW serves /api/v1 and the mock auth client runs. Nothing
# below is required for normal UI work or the test suite.
#
# Live mode (I1) — see README.md "Live mode":
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MODE=live
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://<project>.supabase.co
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=<publishable/anon key>
#
# NEVER put a Supabase service_role key (or any other private/server-side key)
# in a NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable or anywhere in this repo. `npm run test` fails if
# one appears (see src/lib/config/no-secrets.test.ts).
